+| bright_delta | [0, 684431) / 684431 / 678354057 | [0, 643710) / 643710 / 678354057 (same file `…/bright/corpus.jsonl`, sha `0ac9088e4dca`) | [0, 643710) -> 618306 / 603263678 DIFFER |
